  "title": "· New Bags | LOEWE Presents Spring/Summer 2027 Runway Show: A Dialogue Between Old and New Worlds ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | LOEWE 发布2027春夏时装秀：新旧世界的对话",
  "excerpt": "LOEWE’s Spring/Summer 2027 Paris show blends American pragmatism with Spanish Baroque flair, offering a wearable wardrobe of artistic tension and practical beauty.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-10-19",
  "date_label": "October 19, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/7goszl5/9ffadb1ec4a63c2d.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "LOEWE"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE's Spring/Summer 2027 runway show has just wrapped at the Château de Vincennes in Paris. Titled \"A Dialogue Between the Old World and the New,\" the collection sees co-creative directors Jack McCollough and Lazaro Hernandez fuse American pragmatism with the theatrical flourishes of Spanish Baroque art: sharply tailored trench coats are finished with collars in tortoiseshell-effect resin, skirts and trousers are paired with painterly waist ornaments, bungee cords or pleating, and heels are accented with origami-like satin bows. Playful deconstruction runs throughout, yielding a everyday wardrobe that balances artistic tension with practical beauty.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
