    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This is a conversation between the old world and the new. Modernist color blocking meets Spanish Baroque idiom. The New England coastline, sun-drenched Andalusia. The ease of American pragmatism, and a nod to Spanish drama, ritual and history. — Jack McCollough & Lazaro Hernandez",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "(Swipe left or right for more images)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Puzzle Charm ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Puzzle family welcomes a new member: the Puzzle Featherlight Charm. Crafted in soft, lightweight lambskin or crocodile-embossed leather, it takes on a horizontal rectangular silhouette, carrying forward the line's signature geometric paneling. A long strap allows for hand-carry or shoulder wear, while a detachable keyring charm lends the piece an easy, playful spirit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
