    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Flamenco ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Flamenco is reimagined with a flap silhouette. Its signature knot can be secured at the front through a metal ring as a decorative detail, while the supple leather falls into natural folds for a relaxed, effortless mood. Offered in multicolor woven leather, nappa leather and suede.",
