      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The all-new Pasito cleverly merges a boxy structure with a dust-bag design: a soft nappa leather drawstring pouch wraps around the outside of the boxy body, creating a delightfully unexpected contrast. Available in nappa leather, suede and crocodile-embossed leather, it comes with a detachable strap for clutch, shoulder or crossbody wear, finished with a dimensional double-L logo as the focal point.",
